WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.695 --> 00:00:12.155
bit her lip.

2
00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:14.835
"We have to stop the bank robber!"

3
00:00:14.855 --> 00:00:19.597
"Yes, but she probably won't rob again," Detective Smith said.

4
00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:22.337
"She already robbed every bank in the city!"

5
00:00:23.318 --> 00:00:24.058
Roxy sighed.

6
00:00:24.078 --> 00:00:26.058
"You're right."

7
00:00:26.078 --> 00:00:29.779
"There's one more place with money," Mrs.

8
00:00:29.839 --> 00:00:30.380
Betz said.

9
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.720
"What's that?"

10
00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:33.064
Detective Smith asked.

11
00:00:33.084 --> 00:00:35.245
"The mint," Mrs.

12
00:00:35.305 --> 00:00:35.845
Betz said.

13
00:00:35.865 --> 00:00:37.206
"Of course!"

14
00:00:37.606 --> 00:00:38.226
Roxy said.

15
00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:40.666
"The robber will probably go there next.

16
00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:43.067
And I'll be waiting for her!"

17
00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:52.850
Roxy sat on a big pile of money in the mint.

18
00:00:55.411 --> 00:00:56.331
She waited and waited.

19
00:00:57.731 --> 00:00:59.752
Suddenly a small light formed on one wall.

20
00:01:00.552 --> 00:01:01.393
Roxy gasped.

21
00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:03.935
"A wormhole!"

22
00:01:04.675 --> 00:01:05.856
The light spun fast.

23
00:01:06.556 --> 00:01:07.117
It grew bigger.

24
00:01:08.138 --> 00:01:09.519
A woman stepped out of the wormhole.

25
00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.222
She grabbed some money and threw it through the wormhole.

26
00:01:15.103 --> 00:01:18.265
"Stop right there!"

27
00:01:18.585 --> 00:01:19.326
Roxy shouted.

28
00:01:20.086 --> 00:01:20.847
The woman looked up.

29
00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:22.268
"Rocket Girl!"

30
00:01:23.288 --> 00:01:24.709
Roxy flew toward the villain.

31
00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:26.811
The woman held up a blaster.

32
00:01:28.556 --> 00:01:30.637
Wha-zam! An energy blast knocked Roxy back.

33
00:01:31.898 --> 00:01:34.919
The villain jumped into the wormhole—and the wormhole disappeared!

34
00:01:39.202 --> 00:01:40.262
Roxy stamped her foot.

35
00:01:40.282 --> 00:01:42.243
"How will I catch the villain?"

36
00:01:45.665 --> 00:01:46.586
Terrell's phone rang.

37
00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.427
"Hello?" he whispered.

38
00:01:49.447 --> 00:01:52.049
"Terrell," Roxy said.

39
00:01:52.069 --> 00:01:54.430
"I'm trying to catch a bank robber.

40
00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:59.788
I need you to look up something for me—wormholes."

41
00:01:59.808 --> 00:02:01.429
Terrell did a quick search on his computer.

42
00:02:01.449 --> 00:02:03.789
"Hmm," he said.

43
00:02:03.809 --> 00:02:08.331
"A scientist at Metro City University does wormhole research.

44
00:02:09.251 --> 00:02:10.291
Her name is Dr.

45
00:02:10.391 --> 00:02:11.191
Vic Nebula.

46
00:02:11.712 --> 00:02:12.752
Maybe she can help you."

47
00:02:13.772 --> 00:02:14.612
"Good idea.

48
00:02:15.013 --> 00:02:16.493
Thanks!" Roxy said.

49
00:02:23.295 --> 00:02:26.396
Roxy arrived at the university and found Vic Nebula's lab.

50
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.421
Roxy gasped.

51
00:02:31.021 --> 00:02:32.482
The lab was filled with money.

52
00:02:32.502 --> 00:02:35.184
"Dr. Nebula is the thief!"

53
00:02:35.484 --> 00:02:36.144
Roxy thought.

54
00:02:37.005 --> 00:02:39.106
The scientist stood in front of an open wormhole.

55
00:02:40.047 --> 00:02:41.587
She was holding a strange device.

56
00:02:43.328 --> 00:02:44.429
"Dr. Nebula!"

57
00:02:44.689 --> 00:02:45.310
Roxy said.

58
00:02:46.951 --> 00:02:47.671
Vic looked over.

59
00:02:47.691 --> 00:02:49.612
"Ugh! You're here!"

60
00:02:50.653 --> 00:02:52.034
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

61
00:02:52.054 --> 00:02:54.075
"You're a scientist.

62
00:02:54.515 --> 00:02:56.016
Why are you stealing money?"

63
00:02:57.128 --> 00:03:00.029
"I need a bigger lab for my research," Vic said.

64
00:03:00.049 --> 00:03:02.410
"I invented a wormhole device.

65
00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:07.131
When I'm done working on it, I'll be the most famous scientist ever."

66
00:03:08.191 --> 00:03:09.071
Roxy shook her head.

67
00:03:09.091 --> 00:03:11.412
"You're going to jail!"

68
00:03:11.432 --> 00:03:13.613
"No," Vic said.

69
00:03:13.633 --> 00:03:18.014
"I'm taking this money to a place where nobody will find it!"

70
00:03:19.034 --> 00:03:20.054
Roxy flew fast.

71
00:03:20.995 --> 00:03:22.575
Vic pressed a button on the device.

72
00:03:23.455 --> 00:03:25.636
A new wormhole appeared, and she jumped into it.

73
00:03:26.912 --> 00:03:29.053
She popped out of another wormhole behind Roxy.

74
00:03:29.813 --> 00:03:31.894
Roxy spun around and charged toward Vic.

75
00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:33.735
Vic stepped to the side.

76
00:03:34.555 --> 00:03:35.575
Roxy tried to stop.

77
00:03:36.376 --> 00:03:39.017
But she skidded—right into the wormhole!

78
00:03:39.777 --> 00:03:41.638
As the wormhole closed, Vic laughed.

79
00:03:42.058 --> 00:03:46.520
"Now nobody will ever find Rocket Girl!"
